[Slow] 負けたチームの選手が、思い出に、球場の土を持って帰ることも有名です。

34
00:04:54,636 --> 00:05:00,971
[Host] It is also famous that players on the losing team take home some dirt from the stadium field as a memory.

35
00:05:01,572 --> 00:05:03,803
