00:06:59,728 --> 00:07:03,759
[Host] Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

48
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:11,848
[Slow] 夏の甲子園の大会は、何月何日から始まりますか。

49
00:07:12,648 --> 00:07:17,519
[Host] August fifth. That is when the games begin at the stadium in Hyogo.

50
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:24,983
