52
00:07:30,007 --> 00:07:45,920
[Host] That's all for today. The one hundred and eighth summer high school baseball tournament opens on August fifth, with forty-nine schools playing for the national title until the final on August twenty-second. Thanks for listening, and see you tomorrow.

53
00:07:46,519 --> 00:07:48,920
[News] また明日。
